    "updated_at": "2023-01-14T00:48:36Z",
    "body": "I would strongly suggest avoiding using the term \"sandbox\".  It has a very specific meaning in the HTML and CSP space that is distinct from OPFS' characteristics.  I believe there is also a browser vendor using the term \"Privacy Sandbox\" recently that also seems to be distinct from OPFS and could result in confusion.",
