    "updated_at": "2023-01-15T07:36:15Z",
    "body": "<s>Perhaps \"Local File System\" to mimic `localStorage`?</s> Never mind, too confusing with the end user's file system.\r\n\r\n(Default) Bucket File System? (As per https://storage.spec.whatwg.org/#model.)",
